  "job_B3.3.25_20261117_184621": {
    "chunk_text": "se heora halga bisceop, & him to r\u00e6de fand \u00fe\u00e6t hie dydon \u00fereora daga f\u00e6sten & \u00dea on \u00fea ilcan tid \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan bysmerlice & synlice heora \u00fea leasan godas mid mislicum deofolgeldum \u00dea on \u00f0a ilcan tid w\u00e6s se eadiga engel Michahel \u00e6tiewed \u00fe\u00e6m hera bisceope on gesih\u00fee, & him sige & him eac geheht, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde him sylfa geseon heora geb\u00e6ro, & him \u00fe\u00e6r on fultume beon. Hie \u00fea swa bli\u00fee on morgenne w\u00e6ron, & gefeonde ferdon ongean \u00fe\u00e6m he\u00f0num. & hie wiston be \u00fe\u00e6s engles s\u00e6genum, ge be heora sige, ge eac be \u00feara h\u00e6\u00feenra manna fleame & & \u00fea sona on \u00f0\u00e6re frym\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s gefeohtes, \u00f0a w\u00e6s Garganus se munt, se \u00fee hie onfeohtan sceoldan, \u00d0a flugon \u00fea legetu swylce fyrene str\u00e6las ongean \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, to\u00f0\u00e6m \u00feicce \u00fe\u00e6t hie n\u00e6nige \u00dea w\u00e6s gefylled \u00fe\u00e6t se witga fores\u00e6gde; & Drihten herede & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: Qui facit angelos suos \u00d0a flugon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00f0nan leode, & gelice se leg hie cwylmde, gelice \u00fea Cristenan him mid heora w\u00e6pnum \u00dea us \u00fea w\u00e6s gecy\u00feed Cristenum leodum, se Godes engel \u00fe\u00e6r cwom on fultum & on frofre. & \u00fea sona ealle ea\u00f0modlice to \u00fe\u00e6m cyninga Cyninge, to Criste sylfum, onhnigan. & him ealle on hand eodan \u00fea h\u00e6",
